> The amazing thing is that I'd dreamed that I heard [foo] many times before,

This is not surprising. "You dream that you hear <something>" is the
line you when you're asleep and the You_hear() method is called. This
method is called a lot in the code.

> but never had a dream of rock piercers! I had to ^P back to ascertain that
> it had really been that, because I went "huh? missed something?" the first
> time.

The message "You dream of <monster>" instead can only appear when
you're asleep and a monster attacks another hidden monster which
becomes known to you by this attack.

